{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/chrome-overlay.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:09:28.977752Z","id":"02ac31c6bc433731c738a2d9233e66ae51b5af164e1603e24bda2f1265bb7e07","body":{"detail":"Failure: in the just ci run of 2026-10-17 at 86a299ef4 (//web:e2e_chrome_overlay beside eleven other Bazel test actions), until() at line 688 threw 'timed out' waiting for the composer.html frame after the #save click; the test took 1.9 min, with launch.sh sleeping 18 s before the host starts. Rerun alone (bazelisk test //web:e2e_chrome_overlay '--test_arg=--grep=native host slow to start') it passed in 26.4 s.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":713},"end":{"line":717},"content_hash":"d896710dc4d5f39ebfc67021b64d92ecc4d11c855980db9410d4c4ea384fa7f3"},"summary":"The slow-native-host test can run out of WAIT_MS waiting for the composer frame under a loaded gate run","supersedes":"83e0a6e0eb997452a9df8e4cdda40d04bb2c8a9ed37c8b715f8722a9a2fbb0a8","tags":["tests","flaky","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
